<item>
 <title>Cradley Mathon &amp; Storridge Support Group</title>
 <link>https://www.mathon.org.uk/forum/car-sharing/cradley-mathon-storridge-support-group</link>
 <description>&lt;p&gt;Cradley Mathon &amp;amp; Storridge Support Group offers transport to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;doctor&#039;s surgery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hospital, dentist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;optician&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chiropodist etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;to do shopping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;and collect prescriptions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A contribution towards petrol is requested (20p per mile from drivers home - min £3) plus car parking charges if applicable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enquiries to Eileen Vockins on 01886 884366&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
